### Create a new file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files/file
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "file1.txt",
    "content": "This is the content of file.",
    "repoId": "6a02df766ff6de77bb6dd360",
    "branchId": "6a02dfd46ff6de77bb6dd361" 
}

### Get a file by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/files/file/6a02e4ea09325ae118e03f8c

### Get all files in a repository by repo id  
GET http://localhost:8080/api/files/repo/6a02df766ff6de77bb6dd360

### Get all files in main branch of a repository by repoId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/files/repo/6a02df766ff6de77bb6dd360/branch/main

### Get all files in a branch using repoId and branchId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/files/repo/6a02df766ff6de77bb6dd360/branch/6a02dfd46ff6de77bb6dd361

### Update file by id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/files/file
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileId": "6a02e4ea09325ae118e03f8c",
    "repoId": "6a02df766ff6de77bb6dd360",
    "name": "file1.txt",
    "content": "This is the content of file."
}

### Soft delete/restore a file
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/files/file/delete-toggle
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileId": "69fc602f336607d0f0c709d3",
    "repoId": "69fc602f336607d0f0c709d2",
    "isDeleted": true
}
